vFM Player - Saved settings

SD folder: /vFM/config

No download is required here. The player creates player-a/b.cfg, clock-a/b.cfg and midi-a/b.cfg automatically. Use the Settings menu to change values. Do not distribute or install another user's binary settings. layout-v1.cfg is an internal import marker.

Files and instructions:
https://github.com/PanykSystem/vFMPlayer/tree/main/sdcard/config

On a PC, use GitHub Code > Download ZIP, then copy the contents of sdcard into /vFM. Keep existing personal settings and recordings.
